{"985890":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"怒之鐵拳4","steam_appid":985890,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[1585820,3812400],"detailed_description":"<h1>Reviews<\/h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/985890\/extras\/80e6fb1d5c22703ab3c62e2ea4e18456.avif?t=1763718423\" width=600 height=388 \/><\/span><\/p><br><h1>關於此遊戲<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/985890\/extras\/287dbd9c7306c6b8a7ac776b10ab847b.poster.avif?t=1763718423\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/985890\/extras\/287dbd9c7306c6b8a7ac776b10ab847b.mp4?t=1763718423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">人氣動作遊戲《怒之鐵拳4》（又譯：格鬥五人組\/格鬥三人組4\/格鬥四人組4）是對 EDM（電子舞曲）和橫向卷軸動作遊戲產生了深遠影響的知名動作遊戲《怒之鐵拳》系列的最新作。4代在承襲傳統的遊戲方式的同時加入現代的遊戲系統、新繪的美麗畫面，並收錄知名作曲家參與創作的音樂。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>經典角色再次聚首<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">艾克賽爾・史東、亞當・杭特、布蕾茲・菲爾汀與其他經典角色將會重新聚首，使用全新的格鬥技掃蕩街頭。新惡勢力崛起，英雄重拳出擊，在動感的遊戲配樂中維護治安，粉碎黑惡勢力的犯罪計劃。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/985890\/extras\/0bda9a90884b17ed14a7c6b66d74dd13.poster.avif?t=1763718423\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/985890\/extras\/0bda9a90884b17ed14a7c6b66d74dd13.mp4?t=1763718423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>手繪特效與新遊戲配樂<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">《怒之鐵拳4》是系列暌違25年之後的核心力作，經典角色艾克賽爾、亞當與布蕾茲將會回到橫版卷軸式的橡木城中。手繪特效再次升級，並加入全新格鬥要素，而音樂部分也邀請到知名作曲家參與。此次新作是對經典招牌的致敬，同時也讓它煥發生機。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">電子音樂舞曲風的遊戲配樂是怒之鐵拳系列的特色。此次最新作的遊戲配樂將由古代祐三、川島基宏、下村陽子、長沼英樹、山岸繼司等人組成的全明星音樂家陣容親自譜寫。究竟《怒之鐵拳 4》將會帶給玩家什麼樣的全新感受呢？還請各位玩家期待。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/985890\/extras\/700dba8488c5c93688fe07608e080981.poster.avif?t=1763718423\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/985890\/extras\/700dba8488c5c93688fe07608e080981.mp4?t=1763718423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>遊戲特色<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">● 怒之鐵拳系列新作捲土重來！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">● 手繪動畫風格，由《神奇男孩：龍之陷阱（ワンダーボーイ ドラゴンの罠）》廠商再度以全新美術風格來挑戰過去的名作。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">● 線上合作模式正式加入！單打獨鬥，或與夥伴合作，協力掃蕩街頭！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">● 離線模式支持4人共鬥。齊心同力，奪回城鎮！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">● 經典玩法與全新要素的完美結合！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">● 知名音樂家齊聚，全明星陣容譜曲！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">● 加入了大量烤雞！<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/